rom the applicants. On a separate note, I would like to clarify why we are requesting a Statement of Wealth (SoW) related to the company’s funding. To my knowledge, a SoW typically pertains to the origin of an individual’s wealth, not that of an entity. This may be confusing the applicants and could lead to incorrect information being provided. Customer Reply bank statement of the company was uploaded as certified copy showing a positive cash flow for the company."},{"title":"Exchange Services","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-22","description":"Clients are allowed to purchase crypto from website. A gaming operator is not allowed to offer exchange services.","notes":"Customer reply: We do not offer exchange services - this is offered by a third party which is swapped APS which offers payment services to our company. RCL Note 15/12/2025: Checklist requirements satisfied. Checklist closed."},{"title":"Prohibited Countries","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-23","description":"Prohibited countries such as Curacao and Netherlands are found in payments page. Please advise when players are verified for prohibited and sanctioned countries.","notes":"RCL Note 16/12/2025: Checklist requirements satisfied. Checklist closed."},{"title":"Age Verification","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-23","description":"Age verification, please advise at which stage players are checked for underage purposes.","notes":"Customer reply: Age verification is confirmed once the player has submitted his KYC. In addition, we specifically prohibit players under 18 years of age as specificed in our terms and conditions which are accepted by players upon registration. In addition, during registrations player confirm that they are 18+ RCL Note 16/12/2025: Checklist requirements satisfied. Checklist closed."},{"title":"Responsible Gaming","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-23","description":"Responsible Gaming No RG measures on site, these include under 18 signs, reference to RG in Terms and conditions, no links to RG companies.","notes":"Customer reply: 18+, Reference to RG company and Gamble responsible will be added as of the 28th Aug 2024. We are also enforcing a RG help page and developing RG tools internally whereby players are able to implement by contacting support. RCL Note 16/12/2025: Checklist requirements satisfied. Checklist closed."}]}]}]}